WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.592
This course uses V W as a prefix for standard views and M V for materialized views.

00:00:06.592 --> 00:00:10.202
Postgres does not require that naming convention.

00:00:10.202 --> 00:00:13.517
The goal is readability and discoverability.

00:00:13.517 --> 00:00:21.432
Whatever convention a team chooses, use it consistently and document the intended grain and meaning of important shared

00:00:21.432 --> 00:00:21.733
objects.
